## Summary
The article reports on a business agreement for research collaboration between Seoul National University of Science and Technology and KBIOHealth, focusing on quantum technology and advanced biohealth fields. The agreement aims to foster interdisciplinary research and development in these innovative areas.

## Key Points
- A collaboration agreement has been established between an academic institution and a biohealth organization.
- The research focus is on integrating quantum technology with advanced biohealth.
- This partnership is intended to advance interdisciplinary studies in emerging fields.


